# Dashboard design system

Use these rules when building or modifying dashboard UI.

## Theming

- **Light theme**
  - Page/background: `#ececec` (use CSS var `--bg-hex` or body default).
  - Panels, cards, sidebars, main content area: white (use class `bg-panel` which maps to `--panel-hex`).
  - Inner pages and components: white, rounded corners (e.g. `rounded-xl`).

- **Dark theme**
  - Page/background: black (`#000000`).
  - Left sidebar, main content area, right quick menu: `#1c1c1c` (use `bg-panel`; `--panel-hex` is set to `#1c1c1c` in `.dark`).

Theme is controlled via `next-themes` with `attribute="class"`. Use `ThemeProvider` from `@/components/theme-provider` in the root layout.

## Layout structure

1. **Header** (top): Logo (OSMO — same as client: “O” badge + “OSMO” text), 4–5 direct page routes with icons, search bar, notification icon, theme toggle, profile avatar.
2. **Left sidebar**: Primary nav (e.g. All Files, Recent, Favorites, Shared, Tags), then Settings, Deleted Files, Storage with usage bar.
3. **Main content**: Rounded white (light) / `#1c1c1c` (dark) panel; page-specific content (e.g. Quick Access cards, file list, breadcrumbs, “Add New”).
4. **Right quick menu**: Page-specific quick actions (e.g. quick schedule, important items), collapsible; optional tabs (Activity, Comments, Versions).

All three columns (left, main, right) use the same panel background and rounded corners for consistency.

## Icons

- Use **Lucide React** for all UI icons (aligned with [Animate UI / Lucide Icons](https://animate-ui.com/docs/icons)).
- Use **larger icon sizes** for emphasis: e.g. `h-5 w-5` to `h-6 w-6` in headers and nav; `h-[22px] w-[22px]` in sidebar.
- Prefer `strokeWidth={2}` for clarity.
- Use icons inside buttons, nav items, and hover cards consistently.

## Components

- Buttons: Shadcn `Button` with Lucide icons; primary actions use `bg-primary`.
- Search: Full-width or constrained input with left-aligned search icon (Lucide `Search`).
- Cards: Rounded (`rounded-xl`), border, `bg-panel`; hover states with `hover:bg-accent/50` or similar.
- Tables: Header row with `bg-muted/30`, row hover and selected state (e.g. `bg-primary/5` for selected).

## Logo

- Reuse the client branding: a rounded square/circle with “O” and the word “OSMO” next to it. No image required; same treatment as client Sidebar (O badge + “OSMO” text).

## Cursor rules summary

- Prefer `bg-panel` for all inner panels/sidebars/cards so light/dark stay consistent.
- Use `#ececec` / `#1c1c1c` only via CSS variables (`--bg-hex`, `--panel-hex`) in `globals.css`; do not hardcode hex in components.
- Keep header routes to 4–5; define them in `@/constants/nav.constants`.
- Use Lucide icons from `lucide-react` in nav, buttons, and hover cards; use large, clear sizes.
